WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.358
Charlotte's home was beautiful.

2
00:00:11.359 --> 00:00:16.191
The entrance hall had a stone floor covered by a large rug.

3
00:00:16.192 --> 00:00:20.574
The furniture was made of rich wood and leather.

4
00:00:20.575 --> 00:00:25.146
"We'll have tea in the parlor," Charlotte said to Florence.

5
00:00:25.147 --> 00:00:29.584
She led Vinnie and Mandy to a lovely room with a piano.

6
00:00:29.585 --> 00:00:36.570
Charlotte sat on the velvet-covered piano bench and began to play.

7
00:00:36.571 --> 00:00:41.654
"I've been playing since I was four," Charlotte bragged.

8
00:00:41.655 --> 00:00:44.235
"I love music.

9
00:00:44.236 --> 00:00:48.498
Mother says she'll take me to see Johann Strauss.

10
00:00:48.499 --> 00:00:52.615
His orchestra plays at Buckingham Palace sometimes."

11
00:00:52.616 --> 00:00:55.796
"Mandy!" Vinnie whispered.

12
00:00:55.797 --> 00:00:59.150
He had taken the photo out of his pocket.

13
00:00:59.151 --> 00:01:02.229
"The picture is glowing blue."

14
00:01:02.230 --> 00:01:07.356
"We have to find the sewing machine," whispered Mandy.

15
00:01:07.357 --> 00:01:10.686
Then she suddenly called out to Charlotte,

16
00:01:10.687 --> 00:01:14.666
"May we have a tour of your house?"

17
00:01:14.667 --> 00:01:19.398
Charlotte stopped playing, shrugged, and rang a bell.

18
00:01:19.399 --> 00:01:22.015
Florence walked back in.

19
00:01:22.016 --> 00:01:26.336
"Florence can show you around," said Charlotte.

20
00:01:26.337 --> 00:01:29.816
"Certainly," smiled Florence.

21
00:01:29.817 --> 00:01:32.129
"Right this way.

22
00:01:32.130 --> 00:01:39.397
This house has twelve rooms, including a library, four bedrooms, and the parlor."

23
00:01:39.398 --> 00:01:43.474
"Does Charlotte go to school?" asked Mandy.

24
00:01:43.475 --> 00:01:45.992
"She has a private teacher.

25
00:01:45.993 --> 00:01:52.499
Miss Charlotte also takes ballet, piano, and art lessons," said Florence.

26
00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:57.953
"What about the poor children in London?" asked Vinnie.

27
00:01:57.954 --> 00:02:02.291
"Most of them leave home and go to school until they are ten.

28
00:02:02.292 --> 00:02:07.743
Then they work at the factory where their parents work," said Florence.

29
00:02:07.744 --> 00:02:12.071
"You saw some women and their children at the factory."

30
00:02:12.072 --> 00:02:17.300
"Yes, the women were sewing by hand," said Mandy.

31
00:02:17.301 --> 00:02:19.499
"That's hard work."

32
00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:25.019
Florence nodded and said, "And it takes a lot of time.

33
00:02:25.020 --> 00:02:29.657
But Charlotte's father just brought home something special."

34
00:02:29.658 --> 00:02:32.958
"What is it?" asked Mandy.

35
00:02:32.959 --> 00:02:37.795
"I will show you," Florence said with a smile.

36
00:02:37.796 --> 00:02:42.359
Upstairs, Florence stood before a closed door.

37
00:02:42.360 --> 00:02:49.076
"Mr. Singer, an inventor, came up with a great idea," she said.

38
00:02:49.077 --> 00:02:53.644
Florence quietly opened the door.

39
00:02:53.645 --> 00:02:57.542
"It's a sewing machine," said Vinnie.

40
00:02:57.543 --> 00:03:04.602
"You already know about this?" asked Florence, shocked.

41
00:03:04.603 --> 00:03:08.750
"Vinnie thinks it's amazing!" Mandy said quickly.

42
00:03:08.751 --> 00:03:12.784
"Charlotte's father should put these in his factory."

43
00:03:12.785 --> 00:03:15.314
Florence shook her head.

44
00:03:15.315 --> 00:03:21.840
"No, there are only a few machines, and they're expensive."

45
00:03:21.841 --> 00:03:27.871
"Do you know how to use the sewing machine, Florence?" asked Mandy.

46
00:03:27.872 --> 00:03:34.836
"Oh yes, I make play dresses for Charlotte and . . . ," said Florence.

47
00:03:34.837 --> 00:03:39.731
"Curtains?" asked Vinnie, looking at the photo again.

48
00:03:39.732 --> 00:03:42.455
It was starting to turn red.

49
00:03:42.456 --> 00:03:46.579
"Oh no, Master Vinnie," explained Florence.

50
00:03:46.580 --> 00:03:50.553
"Charlotte's father would never have homemade curtains."

51
00:03:50.554 --> 00:03:54.337
"Well, then what?" asked Mandy.

52
00:03:54.338 --> 00:04:01.002
"Just something for me to wear," replied Florence, giggling.

53
00:04:01.003 --> 00:04:06.755
She shyly took something from a nearby chair and held it up.

54
00:04:06.756 --> 00:04:11.193
"Underpants!" shouted Mandy.

55
00:04:11.194 --> 00:04:19.508
The children's eyes closed as they fell down the dark tunnel.

56
00:04:19.509 --> 00:04:26.385
They were back home.
